{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🍦"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレ東音楽祭2019 見てくれましたか?\n乃木坂46、欅坂46、日向坂46坂道グループが集結しましたね!\n嬉しい限りです(*'▽'*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46は、デビュー曲のサイレントマジョリティーを披露させていただきました。\n久しぶりにサイマジョ衣装も着れて、2期生も加わったことによりとても新鮮な気持ちで挑めました!\n歌番組での披露って、何回重ねても緊張しっぱなしだなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しほ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP8468V2Y8QQJB4J3C79QV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nいつも可愛い〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家でゴルフの練習をするお父さんとその邪魔をするチャコ🐶"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP853YMW6H1R4MPC4HRQBG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP864NX5ZJPNCS9ZH2WT7H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nいつも見てるみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP874DD6HET5KZM9YFRTZH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}